/V (Upon analyzing the environmental monitoring results summarized in Table 2\054 personnel monitoring plates for Clea S\056 Garza\054 including left\055 and right\055touch plates\054 showed no microbial growth on the date before testing \05008 May 2026\051\054 the date of testing \05011 May 2026\051\054 and the date after testing \05012 May 2026\051\056\012\012For ISO 5 BSC E001309\054 daily surface sampling of four locations showed no microbial growth on the date before testing \05009 May 2026\051\056 On the date of testing \05011 May 2026\051\054 1 CFU was recovered from S1 associated with Clea S\056 Garza\056 The recovery was documented under ETX\055260518\0550273\073 microbial identification indicated a colony\055like artifact \050White\054 shiny\054 hardened\054 smooth area embeded on agar\051\056 Surface sampling performed on the date after testing \05012 May 2026\051 showed no microbial growth across all locations\056\012\012Settling sampling of ISO 5 BSC E001309\054 including two locations\054 showed no microbial growth on the date before testing \05009 May 2026\051\054 the date of testing \05011 May 2026\051\054 and the date after testing \05012 May 2026\051\056\012\012Weekly active\055air monitoring of Suite 117 conducted during the week before testing \05029 April 2026\051 showed no microbial growth\056 Weekly active\055air monitoring conducted during the week of testing \05007 May 2026\051 recovered 2 CFU in Room 117 under ETX\055260518\0550263\054 which were identified as Gram\055positive cocci and Gram\055positive pleomorphic rods\056 Weekly surface monitoring of the anteroom and cleanroom areas associated with Suite 117 showed no microbial growth on 29 April 2026 or 07 May 2026\056\012\012During the interview\054 the analyst indicated that no obvious abnormalities or deviations occurred during the testing process\056 All materials were disinfected before testing\054 and the relevant cleanroom and ISO 5 BSC were cleaned and prepared before testing in accordance with MICRO\055SOP\0552 and MICRO\055SOP\0559\056\012\012Monthly cleaning and disinfection of the cleanroom suite\054 including the ISO 8 anteroom \050Room 117\051 and ISO 7 buffer room \050Room 117A\051 housing ISO 5 BSC E001309\054 were performed on 26\055Apr\0552026 by Analyst \055 Tamiru Kotisso and Cuong Du \055 in accordance with MICRO\055SOP\0559\054 Cleaning and Disinfecting Procedure for Microbiology\056 All H2O2 indicators passed\054 confirming the successful completion and effectiveness of the monthly cleaning and disinfection activities within Suite 117\056 Additionally\054 routine cleaning and disinfection were performed before and after the testing activity in accordance with MICRO\055SOP\0559\056\012\012It is also important to note that no product samples processed by Clea S\056 Garza in ISO 5 BSC E001309 on the date of testing \05011 May 2026\051 failed SCAN RDI testing\056)
>>
